cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use doekit in your research, please cite it using these details."
title: "doekit: design, analyse and optimise experiments"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Shields
    given-names: Fraser
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3325-4181"
repository-code: "https://github.com/hagneeptatt/doe"
abstract: >-
  A toolkit for planning, analysing and optimising designed experiments for any
  process, using a web app or config files. It covers screening, response surface,
  mixture, optimal and space-filling designs, with model checking and
  multi-response optimisation.
keywords:
  - design of experiments
  - response surface methodology
  - mixture experiments
  - optimal design
  - bioprinting
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
